msgstr "設定I2P統計收集"

msgid ""
"A limited selection of stats is enabled by default, required for monitoring "
"router performance. Only stats that have an optional graph are listed here; "
"for a full list of enabled stats, view the <a href=\"/stats\">stats "
"page</a>."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下只會啟用部分統計項目，以供監控路由器效能。此處僅列出具有選用圖表的統計項目；如需查看已啟用的完整統計項目清單，請參閱<a "
"href=\"/stats\">統計頁面</a>。"

msgid "Enable full stats?"
msgstr "啟用完整統計？"

msgid "change requires restart to take effect"
msgstr "變更需要重新啟動才會生效"

msgid "Select Stats for Graphing"
msgstr "選擇要繪圖的統計項目"

msgid "config tunnels"
msgstr "隧道設定"

msgid "Tunnel Options"
msgstr "隧道選項"

msgid "The default settings work for most people."
msgstr "預設設定適用於大多數人。"

msgid "There is a fundamental tradeoff between anonymity and performance."
msgstr "匿名性與效能之間存在根本的取捨。"

msgid ""
"Tunnels longer than 3 hops (for example 2 hops + 0-2 hops, 3 hops + 0-1 "
"hops, 3 hops + 0-2 hops), or a high quantity + backup quantity, may severely"
" reduce performance or reliability."
msgstr ""
"超過3個跳躍的隧道（例如2跳躍+0-2跳躍、3跳躍+0-1跳躍、3跳躍+0-2跳躍），或數量偏多及備援數量偏多，可能會大幅降低效能或可靠性。"

msgid "High CPU and/or high outbound bandwidth usage may result."
msgstr "可能造成CPU使用率及傳出頻寬用量過高。"

msgid "Change these settings with care, and adjust them if you have problems."
msgstr "變更這些設定時請小心，若遇到問題請再調整。"

msgid ""
"Exploratory tunnel setting changes are stored in the router.config file."
msgstr "探索隧道的設定變更會儲存在router.config檔案中。"

msgid "Client tunnel changes are temporary and are not saved."
msgstr "客戶端隧道的變更是暫時的，不會儲存。"

msgid ""
"The default settings are optimized for general usage and normally don't need"
" to be changed."
msgstr "預設設定已針對一般使用最佳化，通常不需要變更。"

msgid ""
"To modify client tunnel settings, use the <a href=\"/i2ptunnelmgr\">Tunnel "
"Manager</a>, or the <a href=\"/i2psnark/configure\">Configuration page</a> "
"for I2PSnark."
msgstr ""
"若要修改客戶端隧道設定，請使用<a href=\"/i2ptunnelmgr\">隧道管理員</a>，或使用I2PSnark的<a "
"href=\"/i2psnark/configure\">組態頁面</a>。"

msgid ""
"To enable session-only changes to the client tunnels, activate the console's"
" <a href=\"/help/advancedsettings\">Advanced mode</a>."
msgstr "若要啟用僅限本次工作階段的客戶端隧道變更，請啟用主控台的<a href=\"/help/advancedsettings\">進階模式</a>。"

