msgid ""
"In order to maintain anonymity, it is recommended to update using the I2P "
"http proxy. If the news or I2P update is hosted on I2P, using the proxy will"
" be necessary."
msgstr "為了維持匿名性，建議使用I2P http代理進行更新。如果新聞或I2P更新託管於I2P上，就必須使用該代理。"

msgid "Fetch news using I2P http proxy"
msgstr "使用I2P http代理取得新聞"

